# Copy this file to backend/.env (or set these as real environment
# variables on your host, e.g. Render's dashboard).

# Used by src/sentiment_engine.py to call Hugging Face's hosted Inference
# API for FinBERT sentiment scoring, instead of loading the model locally
# (which was a major contributor to OOM crashes on low-memory hosts).
#
# The public Inference API works WITHOUT a token for light/occasional use,
# but is aggressively rate-limited and slower to "wake up" a cold model.
# For reliable use, get a free token:
#   1. Sign up / log in at https://huggingface.co
#   2. Go to https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
#   3. Create a token with "Read" access (that's all this needs)
#   4. Paste it below
HF_TOKEN=
